<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <title>Réinitialisation de mot de passe</title>
    <style>
        /* Base styles - similar to activation email */
        body {
            background-color: #F4F7F6;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
            -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        }

        table {
            border-collapse: separate;
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
            width: 100%;
        }

        table td {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        /* Layout */
        .body {
            background-color: #F4F7F6;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .container {
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto !important;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 10px;
            width: 600px;
        }

        .content {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
            max-width: 600px;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        /* Card */
        .main {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            width: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .wrapper {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .content-block {
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            padding-top: 10px;
        }

        /* Header / Hero */
        .header-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #5d06ba 0%, #2d0370 100%);
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .logo-img {
            max-width: 120px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            background: white;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        .header-title {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Content Typography */
        h1 {
            color: #5d06ba;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 22px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        p {
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin: 0;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #555555;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Button */
        .btn {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .btn > tbody > tr > td {
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .btn table {
            width: auto;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .btn table td {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .btn a {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: solid 1px #5d06ba;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            color: #5d06ba;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: capitalize;
        }

        .btn-primary table td {
            background-color: #5d06ba;
        }

        .btn-primary a {
            background-color: #5d06ba;
            border-color: #5d06ba;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            clear: both;
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .footer td,
        .footer p,
        .footer span,
        .footer a {
            color: #999999;
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

         @media only screen and (max-width: 620px) {
            .main p, .main td, .main span {
                font-size: 16px !important;
            }
            .wrapper {
                padding: 20px !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="body">
        <tr>
            <td>&nbsp;</td>
            <td class="container">
                <div class="content">

                    <!-- START CENTERED WHITE CONTAINER -->
                    <table role="presentation" class="main">

                        <!-- HEADER BANNER -->
                        <tr>
                            <td class="header-banner">
                                <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dccibzcxp/image/upload/v1710898261/afrohk_logo_tp_bdqhdj.png" alt="AfroHK Logo" class="logo-img" width="80">
                                <div class="header-title">Afro House of Knowledge</div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <!-- START MAIN CONTENT AREA -->
                        <tr>
                            <td class="wrapper">
                                <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td>
                                            <h1>Réinitialisation de mot de passe</h1>
                                            <p>Bonjour <%= user.username %>,</p>
                                            <p>Vous avez demandé la réinitialisation de votre mot de passe pour votre compte Afro House of Knowledge.</p>
                                            <p>Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour définir un nouveau mot de passe. Ce lien est valide pendant 1 heure.</p>
                                            
                                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="btn btn-primary">
                                                <tbody>
                                                    <tr>
                                                        <td align="center">
                                                            <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                                                                <tbody>
                                                                    <tr>
                                                                        <td> <a href="<%= url %>" target="_blank">Réinitialiser mon mot de passe</a> </td>
                                                                    </tr>
                                                                </tbody>
                                                            </table>
                                                        </td>
                                                    </tr>
                                                </tbody>
                                            </table>

                                            <p>Si vous n'avez pas demandé cette réinitialisation, veuillez ignorer cet email. Votre mot de passe restera inchangé.</p>

                                            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-top: 20px;">
                                                Si le bouton ne fonctionne pas, copiez ce lien :<br>
                                                <a href="<%= url %>" style="color: #5d06ba; word-break: break-all;"><%= url %></a>
                                            </p>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </table>
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <!-- END MAIN CONTENT AREA -->
                    </table>

                    <!-- START FOOTER -->
                    <div class="footer">
                        <table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td class="content-block">
                                    <span class="apple-link">Afro House of Knowledge, Burkina-Faso</span>
                                    <br> Contactez-nous à <a href="mailto:contact@afrohk.com">contact@afrohk.com</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <!-- END FOOTER -->

                </div>
            </td>
            <td>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
